6050287 #edb/ref 1033 3718 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050287 #edb/ref 1035 #uuid "3d3a8f61-87f6-53d7-a12e-a73126879bd8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050719 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186048429 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050719 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186064357 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050719 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186064358 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050719 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186064359 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050719 #edb/ref 1031 "Dividing With Negative Numbers" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050719 #edb/ref 1033 330 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050719 #edb/ref 1035 #uuid "61178d17-c292-5e1d-a08e-a6ce03bd5a13" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186063941 #edb/ref 1069 "e-12972" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186063941 #edb/ref 1071 "Find the value of $-15 \\div 3$." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186063941 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "5b4f3b5f-2f0b-5178-9055-cf83a9885920" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186063941 #edb/ref 1074 "Here, we are dividing a negative number $\\color{red}(-15)$ by a positive one $\\color{blue}(3)$. So the result will be negative:\n$5$\n\nNow, to compute the number that goes in the box, we divide $15$ by $3$ without any signs:\n\n$$\n15 \\div 3 = 5\n$$\n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n{\\color{red}(-15)} \\div {\\color{blue}3} = {\\color{red}-5}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186063942 #edb/ref 1069 "e-12973" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186063942 #edb/ref 1071 "Calculate the value of $50 \\div (-5)$." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186063942 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "166aaac7-bc88-577a-8e84-47347408e3c9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186063942 #edb/ref 1074 "We have to divide a positive number $\\color{blue}(50)$ by a negative one $\\color{red}(-5)$. So the result will be negative:\n$10$\n\nNow, to compute the number that goes in the box, we divide $50$ by $5$ without any signs:\n\n$$\n50 \\div 5 = 10\n$$\n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n{\\color{blue}{50}} \\div {\\color{red}{(-5)}} = {\\color{red}{-10}}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186063943 #edb/ref 1069 "e-12976" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186063943 #edb/ref 1071 "Calculate $-81\\div (-9)$." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186063943 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "e2005c9d-c0ff-5b8e-bc64-4e222fd19fdf" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186063943 #edb/ref 1074 "We have to divide a negative number ${\\color{red}(-81)}$ by another negative number ${\\color{red}(-9)}$. So the result will be positive:\n$9$\n\nNow, to compute the number that goes in the box, we divide $81$ by $9$ without any signs:\n\n$$\n81 \\div 9 = 9\n$$\n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n{\\color{red}(-81)} \\div {\\color{red}(-9)} = {\\color{blue}9}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186064357 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186049349 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186064357 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186064489 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186064357 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186064564 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186064357 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186064764 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186064357 #edb/ref 1039 "Dividing a Negative Number by a Positive Number" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186064357 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186063941 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186064357 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "b434d0d5-bd04-554b-888e-df84e3961839" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186064358 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186064490 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186064358 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186064551 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186064358 #edb/ref 1039 "Dividing a Positive Number by a Negative Number" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186064358 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186063942 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186064358 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "7de4234d-932f-537c-9eae-746e1711cccd" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186064359 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186050287 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186064359 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186064491 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186064359 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186064549 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186